// ===========================================================================
// FIELD FAILURE REGISTER — the shape of the record, kept out of the screen.
//
// The column order and the headings are the Field_Failure_Register workbook's
// 2026 tab, so somebody who has used the sheet for years reads the same
// register here. The AutoCrat columns (Add Attachments, EO, Raise CAPA, Merged
// Doc ID, Document Merge Status …) are not carried: they exist to make a
// spreadsheet behave like an application, and the document is generated by the
// application now.
// ===========================================================================
